 "details": "The nebula-mesh Web UI host creation ignores the configured enrollment token TTL and instead mints 24-hour bearer enrollment tokens. This can lead to tokens remaining valid for longer than intended, increasing the window of opportunity for an attacker to use an intercepted token.",
